{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20110","headline":"送卢汀侍御归天德幕 · 孟郊","name":"送卢汀侍御归天德幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仲宣领骑射，结束皆少年。\n匹马黄河岸，射鵰清霜天。\n旌旗防日北，道路上云巅。\n古雪无销铄，新冰有堆填。\n清溪徒耸诮，白璧自招贤。\n岂比重恩者，闭门方独全。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}